<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="600" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif" style="">Dear
{!Account.Name},<o:p></o:p></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><o:p><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;">



</p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif" style="">We are pleased
to inform you that your Nawayef West property purchase with Modon is almost
complete. As a valued customer, we are preparing your Sales &amp; Purchase
Agreement (SPA) and we would like to invite you to our Sales Centre to finalise
the process in preparation for signing your documents.&nbsp;</font><font face="arial" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><o:p></o:p></font></p><p style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 12pt;">Date: 2</span><sup style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">nd</sup><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 12pt;">
August – 16</span><sup style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif;">th</sup><span style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 12pt;"> August</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Time: 10am –
7pm <o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Venue: Modon
Sales Centre, Hudayriyat Island, Abu Dhabi <o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><o:p><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">This is an
exciting step towards securing your new home, and our team will be on hand to
assist you through the process and answer any questions you might have. If you
are travelling between the above dates, please contact us to arrange an
alternative appointment.<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><o:p><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">During your
visit, the following steps will need to be completed to issue your SPA:</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"></p><ol style=""><li><span style="text-indent: -0.25in; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Confirmation of your
selected finishing colour scheme.&nbsp;</font></span></li><li><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Provision of a cheque for
the 2% Abu Dhabi Municipality Fees; a bank transfer can also be accepted for
this transaction (see bank details below)</font></li><li><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Provision of post-dated
cheques for the payments due from September 2024, as per the project payment
plan</font></li></ol>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><o:p><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Upon completing
the steps above, your SPA will be issued for signature, after which your
property will be registered with the Abu Dhabi Municipality. <o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><o:p><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">To ensure a
smooth experience during your visit, please bring the following documents:</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"></p><ul style=""><li><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">A valid passport
copy and Emirates ID (UAE residents only)</font></span></li><li><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Any
outstanding documents related to your purchase</font></li><li><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Cheque book</font></li></ul><p style=""></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">We look forward
to welcoming you to our Sales Centre and assisting you in making your new home
a reality.<o:p></o:p></font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><o:p><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Kind regards,</font></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif">Modon Sales
Team</font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial; margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: normal;"><font face="Times New Roman, Times, serif"><br></font></p><p style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"></p>]]></td>
</tr>
